/**
 * insert a new run provided by in all runs
 *
 * @param <T>
 * 		XWPFRun or XWPFHyperlinkRun or XWPFFieldRun
 * @param pos
 * 		The position at which the new run should be added.
 * @param provider
 * 		provide a new run at position of the given cursor.
 * @return the inserted run or null if the given pos is out of bounds.
